Description: Cybroid OS server/pods metapackage
 Cloud-init capable server image with an Xfce desktop reachable over RDP (xrdp) with noVNC fallback, headless KDE Connect (kcd) for phone control, and branding (ADR-0003, ADR-0004, ADR-0005).
